<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cannon Express cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cannon Express cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Cannon Express Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cannon Express closed Wednesday at 8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
